/75.\n- The patient received a flu shot on February 10, 2026. He was given a URI treatment plan on April 15, 2025, and completed his annual physical examination on June 17, 2024.\n- A routine lab review on August 20, 2023, showed no significant abnormalities.\n- Mr. Lindsey is compliant with his health maintenance activities and continues to follow up as recommended. There are no indications of noncompliance with medical advice or treatments.\n\nVital Signs Summary:\n- 2026-02-10: BP 118/77, Weight 192 lbs\n- 2025-04-15: BP 129/74, Weight 197 lbs\n- 2024-06-17: BP 133/75, Weight 182 lbs\n- 2023-08-20: BP 128/80,"
